  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Now that the new Main Menu supports different backgrounds it would be pretty cool be able to customize your profile view with a custom background everyone could see, either from:\n\n- a curated list of backgrounds\n- by uploading your own image / using gallery\n\n(It could be one of the VRC+ benefits, hehe)\n\nDrawbacks:\n- The amount of custom images in your profile could start feeling a bit messy/cluttered if you'd also be able to upload a background (custom icon + custom profile pic + custom background).",
